# /etc/hosts — vagus-runtime-spike, plan task 1.7
#
# Overrides nerves_system_br's board/nerves-common/skeleton/etc/hosts
# (which ships only the "127.0.0.1 localhost" line, no ::1, no hostname —
# see notes.md for why this file already existed, contra the research doc's
# assumption). Adds an IPv6 loopback line, which balena-engine/containerd
# expect to be able to read even on an IPv4-only board.
#
# NOTE: erlinit assigns the real hostname dynamically at boot
# ("nerves-<last 4 chars of serial>", via `-d /usr/bin/boardid` + `-n
# nerves-%-.4s` in erlinit.config) — it is not knowable at image-build time,
# so it cannot be baked into this static file as a literal line. See
# notes.md for the follow-up options if a hostname-matching entry turns out
# to matter for the spike (it wasn't required by any Phase 1-4 verify step
# in plan.md).

127.0.0.1	localhost
::1		localhost ip6-localhost ip6-loopback
